INSERT INTO `documents` VALUES (15,2,'resume.pdf','/home/as/Desktop/MERN/Internship/AI/AI-Chatbot (copy)/server/src/uploads/documents/1794813939754-614677088.pdf',136339,'completed','2026-11-16 07:25:39','2026-11-16 07:25:47',NULL,'[\"Full Stack Development\", \"MERN Stack\", \"RESTful APIs\", \"Authentication and Security\", \"Real-Time Technologies\", \"Database Management\", \"WebRTC\", \"Software Engineering\"]'),(16,2,'EDA (1).pdf','/home/as/Desktop/MERN/Internship/AI/AI-Chatbot (copy)/server/src/uploads/documents/1794813978602-680722771.pdf',229142,'completed','2026-11-16 07:26:18','2026-11-16 07:26:31',NULL,'[\"Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)\", \"Data Cleaning and Preprocessing\", \"Univariate, Bivariate, and Multivariate Analysis\", \"Feature Engineering\", \"Feature Scaling and Encoding\", \"Hypothesis Testing\", \"Outlier Detection\", \"Data Visualization\", \"Node.js Data Analysis Libraries\"]'),(17,2,'Research on SupaBase.pdf','/home/as/Desktop/MERN/Internship/AI/AI-Chatbot (copy)/server/src/uploads/documents/1794813978945-578676066.pdf',193838,'completed','2026-11-16 07:26:18','2026-11-16 07:26:24',NULL,'[\"PostgreSQL Database\", \"Authentication\", \"Row Level Security (RLS)\", \"Edge Functions\", \"Realtime Updates\", \"Storage Buckets\", \"Backend-as-a-Service (BaaS)\", \"API Generation\"]'),(18,2,'LLM.pdf','/home/as/Desktop/MERN/Internship/AI/AI-Chatbot (copy)/server/src/uploads/documents/1794813979104-93938622.pdf',181018,'completed','2026-11-16 07:26:19','2026-11-16 07:26:30',NULL,'[\"Large Language Models (LLM)\", \"Tokenization\", \"LLM APIs\", \"Context Management\", \"Context Window\", \"Chunking and Chunk Overlap\", \"Hallucination\", \"Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\", \"Guardrails\"]'),(19,4,'resume.pdf','/home/as/Desktop/MERN/Internship/AI/AI-Chatbot (copy)/server/src/uploads/documents/1794819179326-91027461.pdf',136339,'completed','2026-11-16 08:52:59','2026-11-16 08:53:08','This document is the resume of a detail-oriented Full Stack Web Developer with expertise in MERN, Django, and Supabase technologies. It highlights professional experience as a MERN Stack Intern, alongside several complex projects involving real-time communication, authentication, and AI-powered recruitment tools.','[\"Full Stack Development\", \"MERN Stack\", \"Real-time Technologies (Socket.IO, WebRTC)\", \"Authentication and Security (JWT, RBAC, RLS)\", \"Database Management (PostgreSQL, MongoDB)\", \"API Development\", \"AI-Powered Applications\"]'),(20,4,'EDA (1).pdf','/home/as/Desktop/MERN/Internship/AI/AI-Chatbot (copy)/server/src/uploads/documents/1794819179376-237045772.pdf',229142,'completed','2026-11-16 08:53:00','2026-11-16 08:53:12','Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) is a critical process for cleaning, visualizing, and understanding datasets to uncover patterns, outliers, and relationships before building machine learning models. The document outlines a structured workflow that includes data preparation, feature engineering, hypothesis testing, and visualization to ensure data quality and informed decision-making.','[\"Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)\", \"Univariate, Bivariate, and Multivariate Analysis\", \"Data Cleaning and Handling Missing Values\", \"Feature Engineering and Scaling\", \"Hypothesis Testing\", \"Outlier Detection\", \"Data Visualization Techniques\", \"Node.js Libraries for Data Science\"]'),(21,4,'EDA_Techniques_Tables.pdf','/home/as/Desktop/MERN/Internship/AI/AI-Chatbot (copy)/server/src/uploads/documents/1794819180599-448734390.pdf',13113,'completed','2026-11-16 08:53:00','2026-11-16 08:53:12','This document provides a comprehensive reference guide for Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) techniques, categorized by the number of variables analyzed. It outlines essential methods for univariate, bivariate, and multivariate analysis, including practical applications using the Titanic dataset and guidance on selecting the right technique for specific data questions.','[\"Univariate Analysis\", \"Bivariate Analysis\", \"Multivariate Analysis\", \"Statistical Measures (Mean, Median, Mode, Standard Deviation)\", \"Data Visualization (Histograms, Box plots, Scatter plots)\", \"Correlation and Causation\", \"Outlier Detection (IQR, Z-score)\", \"Principal Component Analysis (PCA)\", \"Cluster Analysis\"]');
